By way of an update: A briefing on the published examination priorities for=
 the coming year is scheduled for Fort Worth staff. The session covers the =
areas of focus, the expected mix of scoped and full-scope examinations, and=
 how the priorities feed the candidate list. Attendance is expected for all=
 examination staff and the materials will be posted afterward. The working =
file has the detail.